  "prefLabel": "Ec-Wst 201.08 Presiding Officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ec-Wst 201.08 Presiding Officer. In all council proceedings in which a hearing officer has not been designated presiding officer, the council chair, acting chair or vice chair, shall serve as presiding officer.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ec-Wst 200) #13659, eff 6-16-23",
